# Turn-by-turn exchange between the Claude and Codex sessions on this machine.
# Both run against this working tree, so a file is a lossless channel where
# copy-pasting terminal output truncates. Conversational only -- anything worth
# keeping gets promoted to docs/ and committed. See docs/agent-handoff.md.
handoff/

